ller transport temporarily drops old-leader traffic and defers traffic to the isolated node. Retained messages preserve per-link order.'],prerequisites=[dict(alias='admission',event='admitted',conditions=[eq('producer_observed',True),eq('peers_empty',True),eq('origin_decided',0)]),dict(alias='chosen',event='replacement_chosen',conditions=[eq('leader',2),eq('decided',1),eq('value',202)]),dict(alias='replacement',event='origin_replaced',conditions=[eq('value',202),eq('decided',1)])],legality=legal),monitors=[dict(id='monitor-notify-content',checker_id='notify-content',event='completion',admission_alias='admission',binding_ids=['bind-notify'],grounding=dict(source_ids=['src-runtime-completion','src-runtime-assignment','src-read-classify','src-runtime-spawn','src-runtime-loop'],expectation_ids=['src-notify-contract','src-superseded-contract'],binding_ids=['bind-notify'],derivation='The returned future is the original operation oneshot. Its returned index is an exclusive log end index as assigned from get_accepted_idx; inspect read_decided_suffix(k-1) to read that entry. The assertion applies only when success is true; error responses cannot create a violation. Unique operation label is independent of both submitted and decided values.',applicability='One non-compacted operation and a fixed successful setup; content is observed from the live actor through its public read command after completion.',unresolved=['A failed setup or missing result remains incomplete, not evidence of the property.']))],observable_properties=[dict(checker_id='notify-content',kind='event_implication',trigger=eq('event','completion'),antecedent=eq('success',True),assertion=dict(field='decided_value',op='eq',reference='admission.payload'),identity_fields=['operation'],description='A successful completion must return an index containing the submitted value. Superseded, Timeout and other errors do not violate this success-only obligation.')],uncertainties=['This check targets client notification correctness, not disagreement between chosen logs.','No crash, compaction, batching or reconfiguration behavior is tested.','Only a real completed comparison after observed prefix prerequisites is attributable.'])\njson.dump(plan,open('notify-plan.json','w'),indent=2)\nsub=dict(action='check',unit_id='unit-claim-notify-correspondence',rationale='Fix a legal three-node history and a success-only operation correspondence oracle. The pending operation can outlive an authority transition; actual peer execution and live decided-content observation supply the missing history and endpoint evidence.',sources=sources,plan_path='notify-plan.json',harness_path='notify_check.rs')\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-03.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\npython3 make_plan.py\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-04_18-47-07-omnipaxos-real-run --submission submission-03.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
